{"id":694,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The sun powers this Pokémon’s electricity generation. Interruption of that process stresses Helioptile to the point of weakness."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When spread, the frills on its head act like solar panels, generating the power behind this Pokémon’s electric moves."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"The frills on either side of its head have cells that generate electricity when exposed to sunlight."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"They make their home in deserts. They can generate their energy from basking in the sun, so eating food is not a requirement."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Dry Skin","hidden":false,"description":"Restores the Pokémon's HP in rain or when it is hit by Water-type moves. Reduces HP in harsh sunlight, and increases the damage received from Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."},{"name":"Solar Power","hidden":true,"description":"In harsh sunlight, the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat is boosted, but its HP decreases every turn."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":694,"name":"Helioptile","condition":null,"children":[{"id":695,"name":"Heliolisk","condition":"Use Sun Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,39],[1,189],[4,1],[8,84],[12,98],[16,268],[20,523],[24,521],[28,570],[32,86],[36,85],[40,582],[44,87]],"machine":[97,502,213,523,399,91,604,486,527,203,263,447,231,113,490,182,240,156,157,317,496,201,214,173,164,57,129,87,86,85,369,521,528],"egg":[407,525,137],"tutor":[804,799]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-143","name":"Helioptile","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"143","artist":null,"img":"me1/143"},{"id":"me2pt5-63","name":"Helioptile","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number